  "description": "The Horizon Sport 20 is a versatile e-bike built for riders who want a reliable, comfortable companion for commuting and weekend outings. Its LED lighting improves visibility on city routes, and the Racktime rear carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes carrying gear, groceries or a child seat simple – with trailer capability for even more flexibility.\n\nAn adjustable stem helps tailor your riding position, while SP Connect lets you securely attach your smartphone. A 100mm suspension fork helps absorb rough surfaces, and the 10-speed derailleur drivetrain supports efficient pedaling on varied terrain. Hydraulic disc brakes deliver steady performance in all weather. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires ensure strong puncture protection and confident grip for everyday urban travel.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line PX motor adds smooth, quiet power, and the integrated 720 Wh PowerTube battery removes easily for charging. With compatibility with the Bosch PowerMore battery and full Smart System functionality through the Bosch eBike Flow App, the Horizon Sport 20 is ready for daily rides and longer excursions alike.",
